<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  5.09%			 C/S =  8.48%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  Par			   O/N =  2.54%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  8.48%			 T/N =  1.27%</p>
<p>		   Jan  22, 1997			Jan 21, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.28%	1 month forward =  4.41%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  5.94%	2 month forward =  5.77%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.67%	3 month forward =  6.79%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.96%	4 month forward =  7.04%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.19%	5 month forward =  7.26%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.25%	6 month forward =  7.25%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
